    "question": "A student's marks increase from 240 to 300. What is the percentage increase?",
    "options": [
      "20%",
      "25%",
      "30%",
      "35%"
    ],
    "answer": "25%",
    "explanation": "Absolute increase = 300 - 240 = 60. Percentage increase = (Absolute increase / Original value) \u00d7 100 = (60 / 240) \u00d7 100 = 1/4 \u00d7 100 = 25%.",
